  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f130b3cacf575bd4aa13935d7b6d96e7, type: 2}
  portraitId: 
  hasName: 1
  dialogue:
  - I see that you have now mastered the attack, but a good offense without a great
    defense is useless in the heat of battle.
  - Your spear has a unique ability, this ability can block golden attacks and absorb
    them.
  - Once you have accumulated enough golden energy you can use it to heal your wounds,
    while also doubling the power of your next strike.
  - But be careful, you will not be able to absorb attacks other than golden, to
    evade them you will have to dodge them.
  responses:
  - responseText: Understood.
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d70c2f224cf99a34daab9106716df0e2, type: 2}
  - responseText: How can I dodge?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0cbdec8e37e49c348be8dfd8a774cf23, type: 2}
